00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:42.690
<i>It’d be great if Nyaruko could take down her enemies like that...</i>

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.900
<i>Then we wouldn’t have to see such horror.</i>

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.760
That’s it!

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.600
Boy?

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:56.270
I wonder what Mahiro-san is mulling over...

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.770
I'm... curious!

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:04.190
Tune in next time!

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:09.660
Mahiro-san’s love really hits hard...

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.880
Hey, Nyaruko.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.280
What is it, Mahiro-san...?

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:19.620
As a henshin junkie, do those mahou shoujo anime transformations really satisfy you?

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.710
Well, I guess costumed heroes are still the best,

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:26.240
but they <i>do</i> satisfy me.

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:27.640
What about it?

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.300
Good, that settles it...

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:32.320
You should become a magic girl!

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:34.600
Me...?

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.310
How to Humanely Defeat Your Foes

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:40.500
How to Humanely Defeat Your Foes

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:44.320
would you like to run that by me once more?

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.940
This place is really nice!

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:49.680
Is the takoyaki business <i>this</i> lucrative?

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:55.120
Like he said, we’d like you to turn Nyaruko-chan into a magic girl!

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.580
About that...

00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:01.960
Didn’t you do a magic girl show on the roof of that department store?

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:08.990
We thought you would know the most about being a magic girl because of that.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.480
That's...

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:15.350
Well, I guess you could say I know the fundamentals.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:22.340
I never said I wanna become a magic girl who’s halfway to 60, though.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:28.080
That's cold!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.780
Is that so?

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:33.390
If you don't round up like you did, I'm still in my twenties.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.250
If you so much as dare to overlook that fact,

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:42.880
I will bind your entire being with divine chains and leave you to suffer in the depths of R'lyeh.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.880
The transformation will help with her attitude, too.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.220
Please?

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.500
Very well.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.510
I will rectify that unruly nature of yours!

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:08.160
Amazing...

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.580
Luhy, where are we?

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.540
It’s known as the Hyperbolic Time...

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.950
Oh, my. Are you feeling sick?

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.340
It's a space in which time is distorted.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:24.680
An entire year in here is equivalent to just one day on the outside.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:27.040
Isn't this a little overboard?

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:31.580
There’s another world where you can accelerate time by a factor of 1,000 days to one.

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:33.700
In English, it’s called the Accel Wo–

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.240
That’s enough!

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:38.070
Don’t you want to accelerate faster, Boy?

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.580
Here, you’ll undergo intensive training.

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.340
You’ll suffer for two whole hours,

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.460
or about a month in here.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:46.330
An entire month?! For real?

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.900
Did I say you could talk?!

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:50.060
Do you understand, Nyarlathotep?

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:54.450
If you can survive this training, you’ll become a true magic girl!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:57.420
You’ll emerge a splendid girl, who spreads love and joy to all.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:58.950
Everyone will be your friend!

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:01.240
Until that day, you will be a nobody!

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:03.330
The very lowest of the entire cast!

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:06.820
Um... Luhy?

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:09.720
Don’t talk unless spoken to!

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:14.340
With your blood-stained tongue, from now on, you're to say "hanyaan" before and after every sentence.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:17.300
Hah... nyaan?

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:19.920
Are you kidding me?! Louder than that!

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.350
Have you no pride?!

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.160
Hanyaan!

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.600
Understood! Hanyaan!

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:28.140
I suppose we should wait outside...

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:31.280
Good point. We shouldn’t get in their way.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.040
Keep at it, you two!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.630
Well, train hard.

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:37.680
W-Wait, Mahiro-san!

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.640
Magic girls are no joke...

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:45.940
You think you can eliminate sorrow and hatred with that mindset?!

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:47.460
Hanyaan!

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.150
My deepest apologies! Hanyaan!

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:52.260
What’s that? You wanna call me a moronic magic girl?!

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.400
Hanyaan!

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.020
No! Hanyaan!

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:57.090
You’re like a no-good sanity roll!

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:04.620
They’re still not dropping any Heavenly Scales...

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:07.580
Well, the drop rate <i>is</i> only 1%.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.760
She should be done any minute...

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.880
Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:25.000
Nyaruko...?

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.810
Are you used to being a magic girl yet?

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.940
Yep! I’m not–

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:30.060
horrified

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:31.790
–anymore!

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.920
<i>What was that change just now...?</i>

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.740
Thank you so much, Luhy-san!

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.180
Sure...

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:41.930
Luhy-san...?

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:45.680
Lookie here!

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.980
Are there... enemies?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.330
It seems some naughty kids have shown up!

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.880
So that you can all live in peace,

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:55.820
I’m heading out!

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:58.780
In English, it’s called Anything Goes!

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:01.580
Tell me, Luhy...

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.820
Did the training <i>really</i> go as planned?

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.040
Why can’t you face me?

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.890
You had better see for yourself...

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.020
Let's take a look.

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.320
Yeah, let’s go!

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:22.590
Prepare to be punished!

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:37.100
N-Nightgaunts again?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:43.610
I’ll never let you spread your dark energy throughout this peaceful city!

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.370
She's sticking to clichés, I see...

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:51.740
So that I can preserve everyone’s joy,

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:53.740
I’ll become a magic girl!

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:56.750
So just watch me!

00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:03.040
Keyword: N Y A R L A T H O T E P!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.700
In the name of love, courage, and hope...

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:21.340
Magic Girl, Crawling Nyaruko!

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:25.030
No matter what, I won’t be broken!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:30.960
Now you’ve gotten on my bad side!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:37.640
What’s the deal? She's basically the same as before.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:39.300
No, she’s just getting started.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:43.800
You poor little corrupted Nightgaunts!

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:47.070
I shall purify your tainted souls!

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:50.020
Sharanra, sharanra!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.440
Bring back their pure souls!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.180
She’s actually doing it!

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:57.710
They might actually get purified!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.980
Sharanra, sharanra...

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:03.100
Kanito!

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:18.080
H-Hey... This is...

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:25.000
You little brats have had your filthy souls cleansed by me...

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:28.110
Now you’re all so behaved.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.740
Since...

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.600
...the only good kid is a dead one!

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.730
Nya-Nyaruko...?

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:42.980
I’ve already started, so why don’t I carry your corpses to Heaven as well?

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:44.740
You know that's useless.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:48.060
You wanna fill us in, Luhy?

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:50.760
It seems my training may have been too effective.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.640
It’ll all be done soon!

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:54.500
I’m just gonna warm you all up...

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.640
Pipiruma, pipirumaaa...

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:57.980
Harito!

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:02.880
Be gone!

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:09.360
Didn’t I say I’d be quick?

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:14.600
I want her to stomp on me, too!

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:16.520
Not this again.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:23.150
I may have just created the strongest, yet cruelest magic girl of them all...

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:26.900
Not “may have”! She’s even worse than before!

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:30.040
I guess the Nyaruko-san before us might be too much?

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.030
She was better before the training!

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:34.760
Then what should we do, Mahiro-kun?

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:36.600
I’m not too sure...

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:40.260
Boy, I know of one good way...

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.560
And what’s that?

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:43.420
Just in case, put these on...

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:55.330
Which little brat will be next?

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:59.060
There’re still so many rotten brats on this planet!

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:03.190
Oh! being a magic girl is such a commitment!

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:06.900
Hey, Nyaruko...

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:07.440
Yes?

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.600
Morning, Nyaruko.

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:21.160
Oh, yes... Good morning, Mahiro-san...

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:25.090
Huh? Did I just happen to sleep in really late?

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:30.590
Hey, Nyaruko... Costumed heroes or magic girls... which is better?

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:33.480
Why are you so curious about that?

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:36.300
Isn’t the answer obviously costumed heroes?!

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:37.600
Good.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:41.600
That’s proof that Nyaruko’s out of her Full Force Form.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:46.480
I think we can all say we like this Nyaruko-chan best.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:47.610
So I guess it’s Hiro’s loss.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.540
That’s fine by me...

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:53.660
What’re you guys talking about?

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:57.370
Don’t mind it. You just get some more rest.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.370
By the way, Mahiro-san?

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:10.900
Where might the next brat be?!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:21.350
shirokuji chuu be with you
I wanna be with you around the clock

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:27.940
yoku dekitara give me chuu?
if I do well, can you give me a kiss?

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:51.000
watashi ga anata no mae arawareta nara “zutto” nan desu
since I appeared before you, we’re together forever,

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:58.350
suki to ka, kirai da to ka, kanjou izen ni zettai desu
}no matter if you come to love or hate me

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:05.310
nijuuyo jikan, ana ga aku hodo
every day, all the time...

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:12.070
anata dake wo mitsumetai
I want to keep seeing you

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:13.280
muchuuteki
it’s like a dream

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:16.300
kibo no love de I want you
I want you to love me always

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:20.530
soba ni iru yo, shirokuji chuu
I’ll be by your side, now and always

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:23.680
yoku dekitara, give me chuu?
if I do well, can you give me a kiss?

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:27.920
hora, sunao ni natte love me do
c’mon, show me how you really feel

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:31.040
kono chikyuu de rendezvous
let’s rendezvous on this planet Earth

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:35.300
kibou datte anata to iu
you are like hope to me

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:38.300
tokimeki ni deaeta
we met in a heart-throbbing moment

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:43.120
yakusoku da yo zutto be with you
promise me, I’ll always be with you

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:47.230
The lovely days Mahiro-san and I share are back!

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:47.880
They’re <i>not</i> lovely.

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:50.240
For the title, we’ve decided on: Haiyore! Nyaruko-san W!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:51.270
What’s the W for?

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.940
Well that’s for the group of 5 boys fighting for the colonies–

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:54.410
As if!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.570
Anyway, let’s look forward to it!

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:57.570
The love will be 200% better!
